		(property "Description" "Four-button module MCU (Raspberry Pi Pico 2 H on 2.54mm headers, floating ~2.5mm; 40 header pins only, hub decision 2026-09-30). GP2-5=button inputs (shared between grid and diamond sockets, only one set populated at a time). GP6=NeoPixel data (WS2812B x4 daisy-chained via R10, unused in grid/keypad mode). GP7-9=spare/unused (freed up by the 2026-10-01 NeoPixel switch, previously LEDDRV_B/G/Y). GP10=status LED. GP11=mode-select switch."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(layer "B.Fab")
			(hide yes)
